  description: Won every siege he ever laid by the simple expedient of never once
    going home.
  tactics: 'A 45-point iron ward - the blue bar - fronts a wall-thrower. Break the
    ward through sweeping walls and aimed shots, then the true Onslaught starts at
    FULL health: wide fans between the walls. Flank the walls; they sweep, they do
    not chase.'
